{
  "uid": "agent-observatory-overview",
  "title": "Agent Observatory \u2014 Overview",
  "tags": [
    "agent-observatory"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "runtime",
        "label": "Runtime",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(observatory_runs_total, runtime)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "variant",
        "label": "Variant",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(observatory_runs_total, variant)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "1 \u2014 Runs by runtime",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (runtime) (observatory_runs_total{runtime=~\"$runtime\", variant=~\"$variant\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{runtime}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "2 \u2014 Pass / fail",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (result) (observatory_runs_total{runtime=~\"$runtime\", variant=~\"$variant\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "3 \u2014 Median run duration",
      "description": "Wall-clock duration of the whole benchmark run, per variant.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 7,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "observatory_run_duration{quantile=\"0.5\", runtime=~\"$runtime\", variant=~\"$variant\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{runtime}} / {{variant}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "4 \u2014 Median token count",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "observatory_run_tokens{quantile=\"0.5\", runtime=~\"$runtime\", variant=~\"$variant\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{runtime}} / {{variant}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 7,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5 \u2014 Median tool calls",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "observatory_run_tool_calls{quantile=\"0.5\", runtime=~\"$runtime\", variant=~\"$variant\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{runtime}} / {{variant}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 7,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "6 \u2014 Tool failure rate",
      "description": "Failed tool executions divided by all tool executions.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.25
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(observatory_tool_failures_total{runtime=~\"$runtime\"}) / clamp_min(sum(observatory_run_tool_calls_sum{runtime=~\"$runtime\"}), 1)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "7 \u2014 Find an individual run trace",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 16
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Individual runs are inspected in **Tempo**, not rebuilt here (chapter 00 \u00a719).\n\nOpen **Explore \u2192 Tempo \u2192 Search** and filter by the resource attribute the runner sets:\n\n```\n{ resource.observatory.run.id = \"<run id>\" }\n```\n\nUseful follow-ups:\n\n```\n{ resource.benchmark.id = \"BE-001\" }\n{ resource.experiment.variant = \"baseline\" }\n{ name = \"execute_tool\" && status = error }\n```\n\nThe Observatory UI links straight here from each run detail page."
      }
    }
  ]
}
